  "content": "<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252faim-boot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3c357293-8dfb-410a-a5e3-0d778833e154.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Banner\"></a>\n<h2><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nMG1TNv.png\" alt=\"关于\"></h2>\n<hr>\n<h1>截至 2024 年 9 月 4 日，本资源包已不再积极维护。</h1>\n<h1>由于我计划支持的模组数量日益增多，我决定将此模组拆分为多个独立的模块化附加组件，以方便使用。</h1>\n<h2>所有替代本模组的独立模组可在下方找到：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-advanced-netherite-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">高级下界合金</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-appleskin-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">苹果皮 (Appleskin)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-better-end-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的末地 (Better End)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-dynamic-surroundings-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态环境 (Dynamic Surroundings)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-eating-animation-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">进食动画 (Eating Animation)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-eldritch-end-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">诡秘末地 (Eldritch End)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-falling-leaves-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">落叶 (Falling Leaves)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-globox-z-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">Globox_Z 的模组 (LevelZ)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-inmis-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inmis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-lets-do-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">让我们做 (Let's Do - Beachparty)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-no-tree-punching\" rel=\"nofollow\">无树拳 (No Tree Punching)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-regions-unexplored-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">未探索区域 (Regions Unexplored)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-roughly-enough-items-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">大致足够物品 (Roughly Enough Items)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-trinkets-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">饰品 (Trinkets)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-visuality-support\" rel=\"nofollow\">视觉化 (Visuality)</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<hr>\n\n<h2>你是否在使用模组玩 Minecraft？当使用 Ashen 16x 资源包时，是否觉得这些模组的外观格格不入？这个附加组件可以帮到你！本资源包为（逐渐增长的）社区模组列表提供支持。目前支持的模组包括：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">苹果皮 (Appleskin)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/incendium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Incendium</a>（有限支持）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inmis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inmis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/levelz\" rel=\"nofollow\">LevelZ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpartyaddon\" rel=\"nofollow\">PartyAddon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jobsaddon\" rel=\"nofollow\">JobsAddon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libz\" rel=\"nofollow\">LibZ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" rel=\"nofollow\">未探索区域 (Regions Unexplored)</a>（有限支持）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trinkets\" rel=\"nofollow\">饰品 (Trinkets)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>有希望添加到我的待办列表中的模组请求？请在 Discord 上联系我！\n\n在加载顺序中，请将此资源包放在 *Ashen 之上*。</h2>\n<hr>\n本资源包专为与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-16x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ashen 16x</a> 搭配使用而设计和制作。",
